# docs/design/54-offline.md, "What is precached": a client-rendered `@Offline` app's worker also
# keeps its document, the shell every URL answers, so every page opens offline. Nothing injects
# `AppUpdates`, and the entry still loads the offline chunk to register the worker.
client contains // file: offline.[hash].js
client contains import("./offline.[hash].js").then((m) => m.startOffline(import.meta.url));
root contains // file: k-sw.js
root contains "shell":"/"
root contains addEventListener("fetch"
